className":"mt-[1em] text-lead text-ink-2 first:mt-0","children":["Like most websites, our hosting provider records basic technical details when you visit, such as your IP address, browser type and the pages you open. These records help keep the site secure and working."]}],["$","h2","h2",{"className":"mt-[clamp(32px,2.6vw,56px)] text-title font-medium first:mt-0","children":["How we use it"]}],["$","p","p4",{"className":"mt-[1em] text-lead text-ink-2 first:mt-0","children":["We use your enquiry to reply to you, prepare a quote or plan, and, if we work together, deliver the project. We don’t use it for anything else, and we don’t add you to a mailing list without asking."]}],["$","h2","h3",{"className":"mt-[clamp(32px,2.6vw,56px)] text-title font-medium first:mt-0","children":["Where it’s kept and who sees it"]}],["$","p","p5",{"className":"mt-[1em] text-lead text-ink-2 first:mt-0","children":["Enquiries are saved in our website’s content system and sent to our inbox. Only the people at Opsiogen who handle enquiries can read them. The site uses secure (HTTPS) connections."]}],["$","p","p6",{"className":"mt-[1em] text-lead text-ink-2 first:mt-0","children":["We use trusted providers to host the site, store content, deliver images and send email. They handle information only to provide those services to us. We never sell or rent your information."]}],["$","h2","h4",{"className":"mt-[clamp(32px,2.6vw,56px)] text-title font-medium first:mt-0","children":["Cookies and your browser"]}],["$","p","p7",{"className":"mt-[1em] text-lead text-ink-2 first:mt-0","children":["We don’t use cookies for tracking or advertising, and we don’t run analytics. The site saves two small preferences in your own browser: your light or dark theme choice, and whether the opening animation has already played during your visit. They stay on your device."]}],"$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16"]}]}]]}]}]],["$L17","$L18"],"$L19"]}],"p":"$@1a","v":null,"s":"